      "role": "user",
      "content": "i tried doing that, but it just makes it feel more... heavy. like, even if i give him a backstory, the end result is still the same. he's just at a dead end. it's hard to write a way out for him when there doesn't seem to be one. sometimes i look at him and i just feel like the story is over, you know? like there's no point in dragging out the struggle if the pain is just going to stay constant.",
